menu "Xiaozhi Phase 12 validation"

config XIAOZHI_FOUNDATION_VALIDATION_ENABLE
    bool "Enable temporary Phase 12 Xiaozhi validation runtime"
    default n
    help
        Enable the temporary Phase 12 Xiaozhi validation runtime. This is not
        the future production voice assistant. When disabled, normal Gateway
        startup and network routing do not automatically start Xiaozhi
        validation. P2-E and P2-F options are meaningful only while this
        validation gate is enabled.

config XIAOZHI_FOUNDATION_P2F_EMBED_FIXTURE
    bool "Embed the optional P2-F known-audio fixture"
    depends on XIAOZHI_FOUNDATION_VALIDATION_ENABLE
    default n
    help
        Embed test_assets/p2f_fixture.bin only for Phase 12.5 P2-F hardware
        validation. The asset is not a production audio input and is disabled
        by default. The build fails clearly if this option is enabled without
        the documented fixture file.

config XIAOZHI_FOUNDATION_P2F_E2E_ONLINE_VALIDATION
    bool "Run P2-F known-audio E2E instead of default P2-E"
    depends on XIAOZHI_FOUNDATION_VALIDATION_ENABLE
    depends on XIAOZHI_FOUNDATION_P2F_EMBED_FIXTURE
    default n
    help
        At the next application ONLINE transition, run the independent P2-F
        WebSocket audio/STT/TTS validation. Leave this disabled to run the
        default P2-E audio-channel lifecycle validation.

endmenu
